'''Lightbringer''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 2]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Unlike most guns, the Lightbringer is not a revolver, even though it looks and sounds like one. The whole gun is a pathbringer, but white in color. The handle has a golden grip on the underside. The barrel also has two golden stripes. There is a "wing" in the center of the gun that is also golden. The trigger is golden, but the trigger guard is white.

== Trivia ==
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Lightbringer]], which can be found in the same box.
*It also has an [[Unique Weapons|Unique]] counterpart under the name [[Dartbringer]].
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Darkbringer]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Bringer Set|Bringer Set]].
*Lightbringer is also commonly paired with the Valentine’s 2026 knife Cupid, though they are not an official set.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*Unlike most weapons, it is not salvageable in the crafting station.

